'''Edmund McMillen''' is the creator of ''The Binding of Isaac'' series, ''[http://store.steampowered.com/app/40800/ Super Meat Boy]'', and various other games.

Edmund is represented in-game as the {{e|Ultra Pride}} mini-boss.

For a full list of his games, see [[wikipedia:Edmund McMillen|his Wikipedia article]].

